    "body": "Problem:\r\nA buffer loaded (`bufload()`) from a (`BufAdd nested=false`) autocmd\r\ndoes not trigger `BufReadPost` (which does filetype-detection). Then\r\n'filetype' is never set.\r\n\r\nA session file does `:badd` on all buffers before `:edit`ing them:\r\n\r\n    :badd +0 a.md\r\n    :badd +0 b.md\r\n    :edit a.md\r\n\r\nIf a mystery plugin(?) loads the buffers via `bufload()` from the\r\n`nested=false BufAdd` autocmd triggered by those `:badd` calls, filetype\r\ndetection never happens.\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nWhen `BufReadPost` was skipped and 'filetype' is empty, retry the\r\n`filetypedetect` augroup.\r\n\r\nref https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/41663",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-18T11:34:35Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/41975#discussion_r4046197193"
                },
                "pull_request": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/pulls/41975"
                },
                "self": {
                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/neovim/neovim/pulls/comments/4046197193"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "`do_write` uses a similiar approach:\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/9047ee1460ede5aa8b0f0807c15bb554f5dcb8f1/src/nvim/ex_cmds.c#L1964-L1967\n\nIntentionally not using `:filetype detect`.\n- It silently re-enables detection when the user turned it off.\n- It runs `do_modelines` again (redundant).\n- It loses the `<afile>` name.\n",
            "commit_id": "5f1b24ed9673acf9a33907bb8663249e7a784bce",
            "created_at": "2026-09-18T11:13:36Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -1915,13 +1915,20 @@ int readfile(char *fname, char *sfname, linenr_T from, linenr_T lines_to_skip,\n       apply_autocmds_exarg(EVENT_FILTERREADPOST, NULL, sfname,\n                            false, curbuf, eap);\n     } else if (newfile || (read_buffer && sfname != NULL)) {\n-      apply_autocmds_exarg(EVENT_BUFREADPOST, NULL, sfname,\n-                           false, curbuf, eap);\n+      // 'filetype' detection is triggered by BufReadPost.\n+      bool did_bufrp = apply_autocmds_exarg(EVENT_BUFREADPOST, NULL, sfname, false, curbuf, eap);\n+\n       if (!curbuf->b_au_did_filetype && *curbuf->b_p_ft != NUL) {\n         // EVENT_FILETYPE was not triggered but the buffer already has a\n         // filetype.  Trigger EVENT_FILETYPE using the existing filetype.\n         apply_autocmds(EVENT_FILETYPE, curbuf->b_p_ft, curbuf->b_fname, true, curbuf);\n       }\n+\n+      if (!did_bufrp && *curbuf->b_p_ft == NUL && augroup_exists(\"filetypedetect\")) {\n+        // BufReadPost was skipped, and 'filetype' is empty. Retry filetype-detection now.\n+        apply_autocmds_group(EVENT_BUFREADPOST, sfname, NULL, true, augroup_find(\"filetypedetect\"),",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/41975#discussion_r4046197193",
            "id": 4046197193,
            "line": 1929,
            "node_id": "PRRC_kwDOAPphoM7xLBHJ",
